{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_917.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"2a2f7fe91d6bf7e01a163e0b1955c6cfbe629e75c859d97be318ea7ca2e6f3f9","ja":"キレイのヒケツ","zh":"美丽的秘诀","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_917.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"56ea33407a3596e00ab979fd2638063dcfd17afc3ea9474ca9cbfabc7acc178b","ja":"次のエモノは……じゃなかった、ケンキュー\nタイショーは、やっぱ、りおっちだよね？","zh":"下一个猎物……不对，研究对象，果然还是莉绪吧？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_917.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"0066ecab63c2b7ac74e48551c09fc5c28de7d49cce92dcde11e4196470778cc6","ja":"そうだね。大人の人の意見も聞いてみたいし。\n莉緒さんならまだ残ってるかも……。","zh":"是啊。我也想听听大人的意见。  \n莉绪的话，说不定还在……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_917.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"5e402b0e891773d31226272918fb0b942993b330bc7bd34eafb7f1d790b7d1aa","ja":"あら、雪歩ちゃんと真美ちゃんじゃない！\nこんなところでどうしたの？","zh":"哎呀，这不是雪步和真美吗！\n你们怎么会在这种地方？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_917.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"fa9151d67c88356885835a438edbfb6a0c6f1b58ed4a3d2d4130942ca190256f","ja":"あーっ！　いたー！！　真美達、\nりおっちに聞きたいことがあるんだ、あのね……。","zh":"啊！找到了！！真美她们有件事想问莉绪，那个……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_917.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"687b566bc7fe8554a5dacf1c9ff4389a1eaad5cc5bad4b832b69978cf4c7696d","ja":"なるほどね。そういうことなら、\nもっと早く聞いてくれればよかったのに。","zh":"原来如此。既然是这样，\n早点来问我不就好了。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_917.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"0bca557cbc46ef88a94dcbc883428355911ec4df047d23d49bbba3c662b0e766","ja":"そ、そうですよね！　あの……\n莉緒さんが寝る前にしてること、聞いてもいいですか？","zh":"是、是这样没错吧！那个……\n可以问问莉绪小姐睡前都会做些什么吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_917.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"afbe1247c53748b26f3ccaf507b3e3d5a60dc87fbd2e0f0381df43b7d96a5dc6","ja":"もちろんよ！　私もね、ふたりみたいに研究したのよ。\nヨガにアロマに読書……いろいろやったわ。","zh":"当然啦！我也像你们两个一样，做过研究哦。\n瑜伽、芳香疗法、读书……什么都尝试过。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_917.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"bbd6bf59940a4d4d87c14bd5a4aa4d1bc9c297b02d25f6eef5c262db6de59ad5","ja":"でも私が言えるのは、ただひとつ……！\nオススメが必ず自分に合うとは限らないってことよ！","zh":"但我能说的，只有一件事……！\n那就是，推荐的东西未必一定适合自己！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_917.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"b679ceaaaf86c43ac016b18edaa0a27c7e2d14e8fe1a28f7f31e7b8a91b80c1b","ja":"そうなの？　だって、みんなのオススメ全部やったら、\n効果ムンムンで、ウルトラせくちーになれそうなのに。","zh":"是这样吗？可是，要是把大家推荐的全都做一遍，效果肯定超棒，感觉都能变得超级性感了。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_917.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"76adccfa8c6ed0faecc87d4ff54f5a3a4851fe51ac70887aefa0d6c334f9b0d0","ja":"効果は人それぞれよ！　それに全部やろうとして、\n疲れちゃったら、それこそ意味がないじゃない！","zh":"效果因人而异！而且，要是想把所有事情都做完，结果累垮了，那才是真的没有意义吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_917.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"62605c8c901a77529c46bd804e30d9e4af974271cefd893bfe79e2fc8077d74c","ja":"こういうのは、できるだけ長く続けるのがヒケツなの。\n継続は力なりっ！　ふたりとも覚えておいてね♪","zh":"这种事情啊，秘诀就是尽可能长久地坚持下去。\n坚持就是力量！你们两个都要记住哦♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_917.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"d127c14980981e3479e929adbaf74bbef8f2c28a5b790f20a503b2dd07b25da1","ja":"おお～。なんだかすごくオトナっぽい……！\nじゃあ、真美は何やったらいいかな、りおっち？","zh":"哦～总觉得特别有大人范儿……！\n那么，真美要做什么好呢，莉绪姐？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_917.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"bb904e3f64c3639b26f541590b1049b5576a1d5bb8451b1cf7f0b6e5a71e7901","ja":"あっ。真美ちゃんズルいよ～。\n莉緒さん、私にもナイトルーティーン教えてください！","zh":"啊。真美太狡猾啦～  \n莉绪姐，也请教教我睡前习惯吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_917.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"90d9ac796edd11f8b25c76b7f4f4f43de127b85da56fd28e9a1506be3510d547","ja":"……なんか頼られちゃってるみたい？　まあ、いいわ。\nみんなまとめて、お姉さんがオトナにしてあ・げ・る♪","zh":"……好像被依赖上了？算了。\n大家就由姐姐我来让你们变得成熟些吧♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
